00:28:54.318 --> 00:28:56.527
- If you drive. we'll be driving all day.
- Fuck!

493
00:28:56.528 --> 00:28:58.196
Oh. Jesus.

494
00:28:58.197 --> 00:28:59.781
That was them.

495
00:29:05.037 --> 00:29:06.829
Okay. okay. okay. okay.

496
00:29:06.830 --> 00:29:07.956
I'm just gonna do it.

497
00:29:09.166 --> 00:29:11.251
- Shit. Shit. shit. shit. shit. shit.
- Whoa. Whoa.

498
00:29:13.128 --> 00:29:15.422
- Fuck! No!
- Shit.

499
00:29:16.048 --> 00:29:17.591
Get… Stay on them. Stay on them.

500
00:29:21.637 --> 00:29:23.847
- Faster. Lucky. Come on!
- I'm trying. please. just…

501
00:29:36.652 --> 00:29:38.111
Shit.

502
00:29:46.870 --> 00:29:47.996
Okay.

503
00:29:57.756 --> 00:29:58.882
Catch them on the other side.

504
00:30:02.886 --> 00:30:04.471
Ah. we're fucked. We're fucked.

505
00:30:06.139 --> 00:30:08.058
- Lucky. stop.
- Stop.

506
00:30:15.274 --> 00:30:16.733
Holy shit!

507
00:30:17.568 --> 00:30:18.861
This is crazy.

508
00:30:46.930 --> 00:30:48.307
- Cary?
- I know.

509
00:30:49.975 --> 00:30:51.058
I don't regret us.

510
00:30:51.059 --> 00:30:52.311
Neither do I.

511
00:30:58.317 --> 00:30:59.400
What are you doing?

512
00:30:59.401 --> 00:31:00.903
Buying us some time.

513
00:31:01.570 --> 00:31:02.905
Shit.

514
00:31:06.366 --> 00:31:07.784
Fuck!

515
00:31:27.095 --> 00:31:28.388
Cary?

516
00:32:22.776 --> 00:32:25.320
It's over. Lucky.

517
00:32:29.074 --> 00:32:30.492
Where's he going?

518
00:32:35.414 --> 00:32:36.832
Couldn't keep him out of it.

519
00:32:38.041 --> 00:32:39.626
What? Wh…

520
00:32:40.502 --> 00:32:42.336
- I'm sorry.
- No. wait. What are you talking about?

521
00:32:42.337 --> 00:32:44.714
He was in deeper than I realized
and it was out of my hands.

522
00:32:44.715 --> 00:32:46.966
No. no. no. You… You promised me.

523
00:32:46.967 --> 00:32:48.134
I did what I could.

524
00:32:48.135 --> 00:32:49.886
- Sorry?
- I'm sorry.

525
00:32:49.887 --> 00:32:51.929
No. You can't just do that.

526
00:32:51.930 --> 00:32:53.556
It was out of your hands?

527
00:32:53.557 --> 00:32:55.308
You used me!

528
00:32:55.309 --> 00:32:57.185
- I'm sorry. Let's go.
- No.

529
00:32:57.186 --> 00:33:00.271
Okay. wait. No. no. no.
You… you… you can't do that.

530
00:33:00.272 --> 00:33:02.023
Okay? We had a deal.

531
00:33:02.024 --> 00:33:04.692
You promised me! I helped you!

532
00:33:04.693 --> 00:33:07.862
Do you understand that this is my life?

533
00:33:07.863 --> 00:33:10.156
What is wrong with you? You are a liar!

534
00:33:10.157 --> 00:33:12.659
You lied to me!

535
00:33:26.715 --> 00:33:28.634
They shot me.

536
00:33:29.676 --> 00:33:32.553
Cary!

537
00:33:32.554 --> 00:33:34.889
Oh. Cary. Cary. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

538
00:33:34.890 --> 00:33:37.517
I'm sorry. sorry. sorry. Hey. baby-baby.
Don't look down. Don't look down.

539
00:33:37.518 --> 00:33:39.519
Hey. look at me. Look at me.

540
00:33:39.520 --> 00:33:42.271
Hey. Hey. it's okay. It's okay.

541
00:33:42.272 --> 00:33:43.648
Goddamn it.

542
00:33:43.649 --> 00:33:46.192
It's okay.
It's-It's-It's-It's gonna be fine.

543
00:33:46.193 --> 00:33:48.361
I think the gun was a bad choice.

544
00:33:48.362 --> 00:33:51.239
Hey. Hey. honey. Don't look at it.

545
00:33:51.240 --> 00:33:52.949
Look at me. Hey. focus.

546
00:33:52.950 --> 00:33:54.784
- Cary. I need you to focus.
- Yeah.

547
00:33:54.785 --> 00:33:58.830
I need you to focus. Look at me.
Look at me. Breathe. baby. Breathe.

548
00:33:59.456 --> 00:34:02.041
Yeah. there we go. There we go. honey.

549
00:34:02.042 --> 00:34:05.545
It's gonna be fine. It's gonna be fine.
It's gonna be fine.

550
00:34:05.546 --> 00:34:06.796
I think I'm gonna die.

551
00:34:06.797 --> 00:34:10.007
No. honey. No. No. baby.

552
00:34:10.759 --> 00:34:13.219
It's okay. It's okay.

553
00:34:13.971 --> 00:34:15.931
Hey. Hey.

554
00:34:18.308 --> 00:34:21.769
Cary? Cary?

555
00:34:25.607 --> 00:34:28.735
You… You were happy.

556
00:34:29.485 --> 00:34:30.654
You were happy…

557
00:34:35.074 --> 00:34:36.076
Cary?

558
00:34:37.828 --> 00:34:39.371
Cary. open your eyes. Look at me.

559
00:34:40.789 --> 00:34:43.083
Look at me. Cary! You can't leave me!

560
00:34:44.333 --> 00:34:45.335
Cary!

561
00:34:46.795 --> 00:34:49.882
Fucking wake up! You can't leave me.

562
00:34:56.304 --> 00:34:57.639
No!

563
00:34:58.849 --> 00:35:01.018
Fucking wake up!

564
00:35:02.311 --> 00:35:03.937
Come on!

565
00:35:06.690 --> 00:35:08.483
Please.

566
00:35:42.059 --> 00:35:45.562
Wait.

567
00:35:55.113 --> 00:35:56.323
Rand. wait!

568
00:36:17.386 --> 00:36:19.429
Where did she go?

569
00:36:23.934 --> 00:36:25.101
Rand!

570
00:36:25.102 --> 00:36:26.769
Officer down!

571
00:36:26.770 --> 00:36:28.605
Rand! Hey.

572
00:37:14.526 --> 00:37:15.569
No!

573
00:37:16.069 --> 00:37:19.447
No! My baby!

574
00:37:19.448 --> 00:37:22.867
- No. you can't. You can't. Come on.
- No! Let me go. Let me go.

575
00:37:22.868 --> 00:37:26.370
No! No!

576
00:37:26.371 --> 00:37:30.209
No! No!

577
00:37:38.884 --> 00:37:40.511
My baby!
